## Likely Spacelift Integration

The most likely change is replacing direct Terraform execution from GitHub with Spacelift runs.

For example, if the existing process currently does:

```text
GitHub
   |
terraform init
terraform plan
terraform apply
   |
helm / ARC deployment
```

the desired integration may become:

```text
GitHub
   |
trigger Spacelift run
   |
wait for run result
   |
continue pipeline
```

GitHub should treat the Spacelift deployment like any other release gate.

Conceptually:

```text
trigger nonprod Spacelift
        |
        v
      WAIT
        |
   +----+----+
   |         |
 SUCCESS    FAIL
   |         |
continue    stop
```

The same model can later be used for production.

