Conceptually:

```text
GitHub image build
        |
        v
image digest/tag
        |
        v
Spacelift run
        |
        v
Terraform
        |
        v
Helm
        |
        v
ARC Runner Scale Set
```

If an equivalent mechanism already exists, reuse it instead of introducing another abstraction.

